+### each.property.length
+
+Applies length assertions to a string or array property on each array item.
+
+Example:
+
+```json
+{
+  "path": "$",
+  "each": {
+    "property": "code",
+    "length": 2
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Bounded length example:
+
+```json
+{
+  "path": "$",
+  "each": {
+    "property": "title",
+    "length": {
+      "min": 3,
+      "max": 120
